#. y1:english="What's up?\nWell, {PA:10}my sweet little daughter's been||begging me for it.\nShe's being difficult.||She really wants that gold \"Dora-yan\".\n\"Dora-yan\"?\nIt's a dragon. {PA:20}A dragon stuffed animal.\nShe doesn't ask for something all the time.{PA:10}\nIf I could just buy it,||I'd pay anything for it...\nBut you know, it isn't for sale.\nI don't know how much money||I spent on this damn machine...\nGive him a gold \"Dora-yan\"?\n\n\nReally?\n...Wait, {PA:10}you don't have one.{PA:20}||Don't play me for a fool...\n(I have nothing to give him...)\nHuh?! {PA:10}Are you sure?\nUgh. {PA:10}Don't toy with me...\nYou're a nice guy,{PA:20}||even though you don't look that way.\nThank you.{PA:20}||Thank you very much!\nHere's a token of my appreciation.\nYou received 10,000 yen.\nYou gained 200 exp.\nI didn't know||that UFO Catchers are so difficult.\nIf something else happens,||please help me out again! {PA:10}See ya!\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0067.BIN:83_0_0
