#. y1:english="What's up?\nOh! {PA:10}You're the master of UFO Catchers!\nThank you very much||for the gold \"Dora-yan\" the other day!\nSo? {PA:10}What are you trying to get this time?\nWell,{PA:10}||she wants me to get all the \"Piyo\" series.\n\"Piyo\"?\nYeah, {PA:10}they're stuffed animals||that look like chicks.{PA:20}\nThere are five kinds of \"Piyo\".\nShe said she wants to collect all of them||and display in her room...\nWhat a spoiled little girl...\nWell, {PA:10}she isn't really my daughter...{PA:10}||But she does call me \"Daddy\"...\nHuh...?\nOh, {PA:10}I shouldn't have said that.\nAnyway, I know you're skilled.{PA:20}||Can you get all the chicks for me?\nGive him all five kinds of chicks?\n\n\nReally?\n...Wait, you don't have any.{PA:20}||Don't play me for a fool...\n\n\n\n\nHuh?! {PA:10}Are you sure?\nOh, please...\nThank you!{PA:10}\nYou're the man!{PA:20}||Thank you very much!\nHere's a token of my appreciation.\nYou received 30,000 yen.\nYou gained 500 exp.\nHeeheehee...{PA:20}\nShits gonna get freaky tonight,||thanks to you!\nIf something else happens,||please help me out again! {PA:10}See ya!"
